  "notes": "A new version of NovelOS is available. Download the latest version from https://novelos.studio/downloads and install it manually.",
  "release_notes": "## Fixed\n\n- **Read Aloud speaks English again.** On some Macs and phones, every voice sounded like Mandarin. Reading aloud and the voice samples now sound as they should on every device.\n- **Word exports keep every paragraph.** A paragraph with a comment on it came out empty in the Word file. The text and the comment now both come through.\n- **The phone app opens on Android tablets.** Some tablets were told NovelOS Mobile is made for phones. They now open the app.\n- **Focus mode on the phone.** The Exit focus mode button is always on screen, and reopening a book in focus mode no longer forces full screen.\n- **Licence check on the phone.** If the connection drops while NovelOS checks your licence key, it tries once more. When you open the app offline, your saved licence keeps you signed in.\n\n## Good to know\n\n- On 1.5.0 or later, NovelOS offers this update itself and installs it when you restart. On 1.4.2 or earlier, download it from novelos.studio/downloads.",
